From: Jay Leaton <58495321+jayleaton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 00:22:34 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 019/207] deepseek: admit supported dsq-1 checkpoint metadata

The public EXL3 pack published by jayleaton uses dsq-1 metadata with a producer annotation. Preserve DeepSeek's public configuration and jayleaton's pack metadata as a regression fixture. Admit the supported format independently of producer name while retaining geometry, tensor-layout, scale and marker checks. Host admission and malformed-storage tests do not qualify the real checkpoint or GPU execution.
---
